        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Idle : ATM is waiting\n    \n    Idle --&gt; ValidatingCard : Insert Card\n    \n    ValidatingCard --&gt; Authenticating : Card is valid\n    ValidatingCard --&gt; CardEjected : Card is invalid/expired\n    \n    Authenticating --&gt; MainMenu : PIN is correct\n    Authenticating --&gt; Authenticating : Incorrect PIN (Try again)\n    Authenticating --&gt; CardRetained : 3 incorrect PIN attempts\n    \n    MainMenu --&gt; ProcessingTransaction : Select transaction\n    MainMenu --&gt; CardEjected : Cancel / End session\n    \n    ProcessingTransaction --&gt; MainMenu : Perform another transaction (Yes)\n    ProcessingTransaction --&gt; CardEjected : Finish session (No) / Cancel\n    \n    CardEjected --&gt; [*] : Take card\n    CardRetained --&gt; [*] : End session&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="6oE6ymslMdwxVcrzsTJQ-201">
